  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Consultancy for the creation of country Theory of Change - Mali</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In order to implement the multi-annual country strategy (MACS) for Mali, a comprehensive Theory of Change is needed, in collaboration with the EKN, DAF, IGG, DSO, DSH and potentially DDE. This ToC will support the integration of our future decentral and central activities. A consultant will facilitate this process with a 2-day workshop for the country-team.</narrative>
  </description>
